				<p class="type-body mt-3 text-bone-newsprint">
					Hermes Agent, with <code class="type-code text-weathered-teal">hermes</code> on
					<code class="type-code text-weathered-teal">PATH</code> and a route to GitHub Releases.
					<code class="type-code text-weathered-teal">aphrodite setup</code> runs
					<code class="type-code text-weathered-teal">hermes --version</code> as its first step and
