				</p>
				<p class="type-meta mt-8 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-stamped-canary">FOUR STEPS</p>
				<ol class="prose-flow mt-3 list-decimal pl-5">
					<li class="type-body text-bone-newsprint">
						<code class="type-code text-bone-white">hermes plugins install aphrodite</code> - the
						catalog entry: a reviewed pinned checkout of
						<code class="type-code text-weathered-teal">plugin.yaml</code> plus the
						<code class="type-code text-weathered-teal">__init__.py</code> shim, in
						<code class="type-code text-weathered-teal">~/.hermes/plugins/aphrodite</code>.
					</li>
					<li class="type-body text-bone-newsprint">
						<code class="type-code text-bone-white">hermes plugins enable aphrodite</code> - or
						answer yes at the Enable now? prompt. Enabling is a separate write to Hermes's own
